    "Markdown!axiom1soundguide": {
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Axiom 1: Sound guide",
      "renderMode": "static",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "markdown": "**Robotical sound sensor** · 30-second scalar history\n\n**Spectrum index → Hz:** 0 → 31.5 · 1 → 63 · 2 → 125 · 3 → 250 · 4 → 500 · 5 → 1k · 6 → 2k · 7 → 4k · 8 → 8k\n\nThe spectrum shows the latest nine band levels, with gaps for invalid bins. dBA and dB use separate plots; calibration/reference follows the sensor. Flux is the firmware value. Status is an undecoded bitmask; seq and clipCount are 8-bit values.\n\nScalar plots use receipt time. The script retains the sample header. Check `/axiom1/devices` for freshness: disconnecting can leave the last spectrum visible. This sensor reports features, not recorded audio."
    },
